00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.520
and really to just to celebrate

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:57.367
the different types of
things that I've done

00:02:57.367 --> 00:02:58.800
in terms of my pedagogy and research.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.050
So thank you again, Quan.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:04.520
I want to also take this
